My personal, custom world filled with MILFs & Daughters, all representing different personalities. Romance a mother, a daughter or sometimes - even both of them at the same time.

****Ikeda Family****
Ikeda Asami [Mother (Divorced)] is a divorced HR specialist MILF who loves working with people. She loves her daughter Ikumi even more. They are very close, living together in their apartment in Tokyo.

